
chrome-wayland (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Wayland GPU acceleration: remove obsolete --ozone-platform-hint=auto
  * Replace --enable-features=AcceleratedVideoDecodeLinuxGL with
    VaapiVideoDecodeLinuxGL,VaapiVideoEncoder for VA-API video acceleration
  * Add --use-angle=gl to prevent GPU process crash (ANGLE OpenGL backend)
  * Add --enable-gpu-rasterization for GPU-accelerated rasterization
  * Keep --ozone-platform=wayland, --enable-wayland-ime,
    --wayland-text-input-version=3, --ignore-gpu-blocklist, --enable-zero-copy

  -- WJQSERVER (WJQSERVER-STUDIO) <admin@wjqserver.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0800